    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<strong>Welcome to our Relaxing Simulator, a unique experience designed to calm the senses, relax the mind, and nurture the soul.</strong> In a hectic world where stress and hustle are omnipresent, our game offers an oasis of serenity and tranquility.<br><br><strong>Immerse yourself in an immersive environment filled with natural beauty.</strong> Each location has been carefully crafted to create an atmosphere of relaxation and peace. Listen to the soothing sounds and enjoy the surroundings. Interact with objects as needed to view, turn on, or open them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965380/extras/3eaa9fa95340289b933c72b54cf15ec9.avif?t=1753987903\" width=616 height=260 /></span><br><br><strong>Our game offers relaxing activities aimed at calming the mind and relaxing the body.</strong> Explore locations in the virtual world to establish a deeper connection with yourself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965380/extras/5cfdaac248bd662866b51ecb5fe161e1.avif?t=1753987903\" width=616 height=260 /></span><br><br><strong>Our aim is to create a digital sanctuary where players can take a break from the stresses of everyday life.</strong> With a harmonious combination of visual aesthetics, relaxing music, and soothing activities, we invite players to leave the hustle and bustle of life behind and immerse themselves in the world of inner peace. Welcome to our Relaxing Simulator - a place where relaxation and rejuvenation take center stage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965380/extras/6fa5c6bdecaba59090bfe861c7671efa.avif?t=1753987903\" width=616 height=260 /></span><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>- Experience complete freedom in first-person perspective to move around freely.<br>- Enjoy the surroundings with music or ambient sounds.<br>- There are 8 different environments available.<br>- Interact with objects, furniture, and doors to actively explore the world.<br>- Set the time of day to create the desired atmosphere in your surroundings. You can also watch the sunrise and sunset.<br><br><strong>Highlights:</strong><br>- Earn numerous achievements through diverse challenges.<br>- A global leaderboard to showcase how long you've enjoyed your tranquility.<br><br><strong>More:</strong><br>- You love this game and want additional environments to relax in. Share your ideas in the CommunityHUB and let's talk about them together.<br><br><strong>Note:</strong><br>This experimental project offers you a digital sanctuary. The game has no story, no characters, no running or jumping or anything like that. You move forward standing and running and are located on mini-maps.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Welcome to our Relaxing Simulator, a unique experience designed to calm the senses, relax the mind, and nurture the soul.</strong> In a hectic world where stress and hustle are omnipresent, our game offers an oasis of serenity and tranquility.<br><br><strong>Immerse yourself in an immersive environment filled with natural beauty.</strong> Each location has been carefully crafted to create an atmosphere of relaxation and peace. Listen to the soothing sounds and enjoy the surroundings. Interact with objects as needed to view, turn on, or open them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965380/extras/3eaa9fa95340289b933c72b54cf15ec9.avif?t=1753987903\" width=616 height=260 /></span><br><br><strong>Our game offers relaxing activities aimed at calming the mind and relaxing the body.</strong> Explore locations in the virtual world to establish a deeper connection with yourself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965380/extras/5cfdaac248bd662866b51ecb5fe161e1.avif?t=1753987903\" width=616 height=260 /></span><br><br><strong>Our aim is to create a digital sanctuary where players can take a break from the stresses of everyday life.</strong> With a harmonious combination of visual aesthetics, relaxing music, and soothing activities, we invite players to leave the hustle and bustle of life behind and immerse themselves in the world of inner peace. Welcome to our Relaxing Simulator - a place where relaxation and rejuvenation take center stage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965380/extras/6fa5c6bdecaba59090bfe861c7671efa.avif?t=1753987903\" width=616 height=260 /></span><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>- Experience complete freedom in first-person perspective to move around freely.<br>- Enjoy the surroundings with music or ambient sounds.<br>- There are 8 different environments available.<br>- Interact with objects, furniture, and doors to actively explore the world.<br>- Set the time of day to create the desired atmosphere in your surroundings. You can also watch the sunrise and sunset.<br><br><strong>Highlights:</strong><br>- Earn numerous achievements through diverse challenges.<br>- A global leaderboard to showcase how long you've enjoyed your tranquility.<br><br><strong>More:</strong><br>- You love this game and want additional environments to relax in. Share your ideas in the CommunityHUB and let's talk about them together.<br><br><strong>Note:</strong><br>This experimental project offers you a digital sanctuary. The game has no story, no characters, no running or jumping or anything like that. You move forward standing and running and are located on mini-maps.",
    "short_description": "Discover tranquility and serenity. Immerse yourself in a world of natural beauty, relaxing music, and soothing activities. This experimental project offers a digital sanctuary. Explore places, find inner balance and escape the stress of everyday life.",
